        "sendTo": "={{ $('Find Patient').item.json.Email }}",
        "subject": "URGENT: High Risk Medical Report | AI Hospital",
        "message": "=<h2>High Risk Medical Report Alert</h2>\n\n<p>A medical report has been flagged for priority review.</p>\n\n<p>\n<b>Patient:</b> {{ $('Find Patient').item.json[\"Name\"] }}<br>\n<b>Patient ID:</b> {{ $('Find Patient').item.json[\"Patient ID\"] }}<br>\n<b>Risk Level:</b> {{ $json[\"Risk Level\"] }}\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<b>AI Summary:</b><br>\n{{ $json[\"Summary\"] }}\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<b>Doctor Advice:</b><br>\n{{ $json[\"Doctor Advice\"] }}\n</p>\n\n<p>Please review the patient's original report and AI-generated summary before taking clinical action.</p>\n\n<p>\nRegards,<br>\n<b>AI Hospital Management System</b>\n</p>",
